# Sikkim Darshan — environment
#
# Every value here is OPTIONAL. The app builds, renders and deploys with this
# file empty: the archive ships as typed data in src/data, so there is no
# hard dependency on any external service.

# --- Public origin (set this before any real deploy) -----------------------
# Absolute URLs in metadata — Open Graph images, canonicals, sitemap entries —
# have to name a host. Unset, SITE_URL falls back to http://localhost:3000, so
# every shared link and every social preview points at a machine that is not
# the internet. This is the one value here that is optional for `npm run dev`
# and effectively required for production.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=

# --- Supabase (optional live overlay) -------------------------------------
# Without these, getSupabase() returns null and every page falls back to the
# local data layer. To go live: create a free Supabase project, run
# supabase/schema.sql then supabase/seed.sql in the SQL editor, and paste the
# project URL and PUBLISHABLE key below.
#
# Only the publishable (or legacy anon) key belongs here. NEXT_PUBLIC_* values
# are shipped to the browser — the service-role key must never appear.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# --- Anthropic (optional, research engine only) ----------------------------
# Powers the TerraStory research engine's claim extraction and narrative
# composition (scripts/research/). Unset, the engine reports the provider as
# UNAVAILABLE and falls back to a deterministic rule-based extractor -- it
# never guesses, and the site builds and renders exactly the same without it.
#
# Never referenced by the application at request time: research and narrative
# generation are offline jobs, so opening a page cannot create a paid call.
#
#   export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=...
#   npm run research:evaluate -- --live
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Google Maps Platform (optional, agents only) --------------------------
# Used by `npm run agent:360` to query the Street View Static metadata
# endpoint, the only sanctioned way to check panorama availability. Unset, the
# agent records an explicit "not checked" result instead of guessing.
# Never referenced by the app itself.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# --- Agent reproducibility (optional) --------------------------------------
# Pins the "retrieved at" date stamped onto records by `npm run agent:discover`
# so a re-run reproduces an earlier output. Defaults to today.
RETRIEVED_AT=

